              <button type="button" class="suggested-prompt px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-surface-container-low border border-light-outline-variant/60 hover:border-light-primary font-label text-label-sm text-light-on-surface transition-colors duration-state-change">What are the important findings?</button>
              <button type="button" class="suggested-prompt px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-surface-container-low border border-light-outline-variant/60 hover:border-light-primary font-label text-label-sm text-light-on-surface transition-colors duration-state-change">Compare two topics from my documents</button>
